{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeMonodromyJordan","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeDihedralBraidReduction"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.bar_kills_nilpotent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.bar_kills_nilpotent","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L134-L156","doc":"**Derived, not restated** (§3b-cond rule 5): the ρ-partner\nautomatically kills the conjugate nilpotent — from `kills_nilpotent`,\n`rho_compat`, and the exchange `monodromyN_star`. The fields are\nnon-degenerate: they force the partner to factor through the conjugate\nsemisimple quotient without saying so. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.rho_compat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.rho_compat","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L132-L132","doc":"The ρ-intertwining law: conjugation carries the assignment to its\npartner (`F ∘ ρ = conj ∘ F` at the assignment level). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.kills_nilpotent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.kills_nilpotent","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L129-L129","doc":"The assignment kills the nilpotent: the target sees only the\nsemisimple quotient of the local monodromy. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.map_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.map_add","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L126-L126","doc":"Additivity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.toFunBar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.toFunBar","kind":"def","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L124-L124","doc":"The ρ-partner assignment onto the `H^{0,1}` model. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.toFun","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.toFun","kind":"def","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L122-L122","doc":"The assignment onto the `H^{1,0}` model. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L120-L120","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.TauAssignmentData","kind":"structure","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L112-L132","doc":"**The typed τ-assignment obligation** (the module side of the\n`TauRhoHodgeLift` wall): a linear map from the length-rule module to the\n`H^{1,0}` model that kills the nilpotent — factoring through the\nsemisimple quotient, the local-to-global monodromy step — together with a\nρ-partner map and the conjugation intertwining law. Content-bearing (four\nquantified laws, no `True`); NO instance is declared: inhabiting this with\nfunctorial provenance (the map arising from the framework's τ on the\nT1–T3 geometric side) IS the remaining wall content. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.jordan_sq_zero_bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.jordan_sq_zero_bar","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L87-L110","doc":"**`N̄² = 0`, by conjugation transport** — derived from the merged\n`jordan_sq_zero`, not re-proved: conjugating the `i`-Jordan relation gives\nthe `(−i)`-Jordan relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.monodromyN_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.monodromyN_star","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L71-L85","doc":"**ρ exchanges the two Jordan structures**: conjugation carries the\n`i`-nilpotent to the `(−i)`-nilpotent — `star ∘ N = N̄ ∘ star`, entrywise,\nat every rank. The algebraic twin of the geometric deck-eigenspace\nexchange (T3). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.monodromyNbar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.monodromyNbar","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L66-L69","doc":"The conjugate nilpotent: the `(−i)`-Jordan structure `N̄ v = σ̄v + i·v`\n(the generator action at the conjugated parameter `h̄ = −2i`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.channel_vectors_collide_at_monodromy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.channel_vectors_collide_at_monodromy","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration.lean#L49-L64","doc":"**The channel vectors collide at the monodromy point**: at `q = i` the\ne₊ vector `σv + q⁻¹·v` and the e₋ vector `σv − q·v` are BOTH the nilpotent\n`N v = σv − i·v`. The channel pair collapses onto the Jordan weight\nfiltration at the degenerate locus — the exact domain datum of the\nτ-functor's evaluation there. ","signatureChunk":0}]}